hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"199","[AI-translation] Hamein hadees bayaan kiye Muhammad bin Yahya ne, farmaya: hamein hadees bayaan kiye Muhammad bin 'Abd al-'Aziz al-Ramli ne, farmaya: hamein hadees bayaan kiye 'Abdullah bin Yazid bin al-Salt ne, riwayat karte hain Muhammad bin Ishaq se, unhone riwayat ki Yazid bin Ruman se, unhone 'Urwah se, unhone 'Aisha se: ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne tarbooz ratab (taazah khajoor) ke saath khaaya."
"200","[AI-translation] Hamein hadees bayaan kiye Qutaybah bin Sa'id ne, riwayat karte hain Malik bin Anas se (h), aur hamein hadees bayaan kiye Ishaq bin Musa ne, farmaya: hamein hadees bayaan kiye Ma'n ne, farmaya: hamein hadees bayaan kiye Malik ne, riwayat karte hain Suhayl bin Abi Salih se, apne waalid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhone kaha: Log jab awwal phal dekhte to use Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke paas le aate. Pas jab Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam use lete, to farmate: Aye Allah! Hamein hamare phalon mein barkat de, hamein hamare shehar (Madinah) mein barkat de, aur hamein hamare sa' aur mudd (paimane) mein barkat de. Aye Allah! Beshak Ibrahim aapke bandah, aapke khalil aur aapke nabi hain, aur beshak main aapka bandah aur aapka nabi hoon. Aur beshak unhone aapko Makkah ke liye pukara, aur main aapko Madinah ke liye pukarta hoon, usi tarah se jis tarah unhone aapko Makkah ke liye pukara tha, aur uske saath waisa hi. Farmaya: Phir aap sab se chhote bachche ko jise dekhte, bulate aur wo phal use de dete."
